  m_Text: "Welcome to tutorial!\n\nThis tutorial provides a step-by-step guide to
    developing a LerioSayaw for learning Philippine folk dances, specifically Lerion
    and Cari\xF1osa. Utilizing 3D graphics, the application offers an immersive and
    interactive environment where users can practice dance steps while integrating
    cultural education, ensuring a structured approach to preserving and learning
    traditional Filipino dances."
